# Zodiak webfonts — ITF Free Font License (FFL) §02 prohibits distributing the
# font files through a public repository. They are fetched directly from
# Fontshare on install via `npm run fonts:zodiak` (see frontend/scripts/).
# The @font-face CSS stays tracked; only the binaries are ignored.
frontend/src/fonts/zodiak/
